# Generated Output — Do Not Edit

**Never** fix bugs by hand-editing build artifacts or consumer copies. Change **source** in this repo (or the consumer generator), then rebuild, tag, and let consumers refresh.

## Do not edit (fix upstream instead)

| Path | Fix in |
|------|--------|
| `packages/*/out/**` | `npm run build` in **core2ai** |
| `node_modules/**` (any repo) | Install / pin refresh — not manual patches |
| api2ai/db2ai `packages/extension/demos/generated/**` | Generator or DSL in that consumer, or mcp-host/codegen here + release + consumer `core2ai:use-pin` / `bundle:mcp-runtime` / `generate:all` |
| api2ai/db2ai `packages/cli/resources/mcp-serve-emitted.mjs` | Consumer `npm run bundle:mcp-runtime` after pin refresh |

Do **not** use manual `cp` into `node_modules` or consumer `generated/**` as a permanent fix.

## Publisher workflow

After **`packages/mcp-host/**`** or **`packages/codegen/**`** changes: `npm run build && npm run check`, then skill **guided release** so api2ai/db2ai can refresh pin, bundle, and regenerate.

See [core2ai-consumer-impact.mdc](./core2ai-consumer-impact.mdc) and [core2ai-build.mdc](./core2ai-build.mdc).
